                    return [[arg2 ? "Ah! You're...Hudson Foster, aren't you?" : "Hudson Foster, was it?", "Michael"], [arg2 ? "H-Huh? You...know me?" : "Wh-Who wants to know?", "Hudson"], ["You can call me Michael. I want to offer my support, for I understand things have been difficult for you.", "Michael"], ["...Really? You...You mean that?", "Hudson"], ["I too understand the plight of having a father who...stunted my growth, let's say.", "Michael"], ["Despite the trials of our youth, here we stand, ready to carve our own path.", "Michael"], ["We are independent, and far stronger than the cowardly men who raised us.", "Michael"], ["Y-Yeah...Yeah!", "Hudson"], ["You're right! If I've survived this long, I...I must REALLY be strong!", "Hudson"], ["Of course. I'm glad my words could be of use to a kindred sort.", "Michael"], ["And, just between you and me...", "Michael"], ["...You did the right thing. I would've done the exact same thing in your position.", "Michael"], ["...Oh, OF COURSE!!!", "Hudson"], ["I'm...Sorry?", "Michael"], ["Of COURSE there's a catch! I can't just have- SOMEbody come up and support me!", "Hudson"], ["It's always about the fire! ALWAYS!!!", "Hudson"], ["And not only are you saying I did it, but you're SUPPORTING ME FOR IT???", "Hudson"], ["WHAT THE HELL IS WRONG WITH YOU?!", "Hudson"], ["Well, it was really the best course of acti-", "Michael"], ["Whatever. Wh-Whatever! I don't- I don't even care. Anymore. At all.", "Hudson"], ["Just... G-Go back to the actually supportive crap, okay?", "Hudson"], ["...Of course. My apologies.", "Michael"]];
                
                case UnknownEnum.Value_14:
                    return [["Elizabeth, what are you doing here!?", "Michael"], ["I died, remember? Oh, I suppose you were very young at the time...", "Elizabeth"], ["No, no, I know that, I mean-", "Michael"], ["Do you still feed people to the animatronics? Father told me you've been very naughty here.", "Elizabeth"], ["Wh-what? NO! No! Th-that was the past, I've...", "Michael"], ["...Father? He's...he's spoken to you? Here?", "Michael"], ["He also told me if I went with you, I'd end up all purple and smelly just like you.", "Elizabeth"], ["He tells me it's contagious.", "Elizabeth"], ["...Listen, Elizabeth, I understand you have no reason to trust me after all I've done...", "Michael"], ["...But if you come along with me, you will be much safer than you are here, and ESPECIALLY much safer than you would be with father.", "Michael"], ["I don't knoooow...", "Elizabeth"], ["...If you come along with me, I'll play dolls with you.", "Michael"], ["Promise?", "Elizabeth"], ["I solemnly swear.", "Michael"], ["Okay! Yay!", "Elizabeth"]];
                
                case UnknownEnum.Value_17:
                    return [["Hello. Pardon my prying, but you wouldn't happen to be related to a \"Mike\", would you?", "Michael"], ["Yeah, but he says not to talk to strangers who smell worse than they sound.", "Mary"], ["...He's a very wise man.", "Michael"], ["I'm Michael, I've worked with your brother in the past.", "Michael"], ["It's incredible that you're picking all of the wrong openings, but please continue, Mike 2.", "Mary"], ["...My apologies. I'm not particularly used to being able to have a conversation without the other party dashing for a phone or a firearm.", "Michael"], ["That's exactly what I'm talking about, if you just opened with that you totally would've been shot or stabbed by now.", "Mary"], ["Unfortunately for you, it's me. So now you're stuck babysitting with a traumatized sassy teenager.", "Mary"], ["...If it's a chance to prove I can keep at least one person out of danger, then so be it.", "Michael"]];
                
                case UnknownEnum.Value_9:
                    return [["...Pray tell, but I'm told you're something of a channel surfer.", "Michael"], ["I simply have to ask, seeing as I struggle to find anyone else to discuss it with...", "Michael"], ["...Have you seen the Immortal and the Restless?", "Michael"], ["Billy half-heartedly nodded and shrugged.", ""], ["...You didn't like it?! Why not?", "Michael"], ["I, for one, think Vlad's an incredibly creative take on the deadbeat dad archetype.", "Michael"], ["It really opens up a lot of unique plotlines, ones a standard family dad couldn't get into.", "Michael"], ["And above ALL else, the...", "Michael"], ["Wait. Did you only watch season 1?", "Michael"], ["Billy nodded.", ""], ["Ah, that would do it. Even if I like it, season 1 IS often considered the weakest season.", "Michael"], ["Season 2 got a real budget bump. That's when the writers finally found their footing!", "Michael"], ["...I can share my DVD set with you, if you'd like to give it another chance.", "Michael"], ["That's an offer Billy couldn't refuse!", ""]];
                
