ke you wanted us to!", "Frank"], ["...But while I was fleeing the scene, I wound up running right into traffic.", "Frank"], ["...Ah.", "Henry"], ["I...I apologize. I should've known such practices would get people hurt.", "Henry"], ["No worries, man! That rule's worked every OTHER time!", "Frank"]];
                
