                case UnknownEnum.Value_5:
                    return [["You're...that girl who used to wear that homemade rabbit costume, aren't you?", "Fiona"], ["G-GAH!! Don't REMIND me! Ohh, what a TERRIBLE first impression to leave...", "Vannabelle"], ["Oh, no no, goodness no! I'm sorry, I didn't mean anything by it! It's just...", "Fiona"], ["...Well, you remind me a bit of my younger self, I suppose.", "Fiona"], ["H-Huh?", "Vannabelle"], ["I actually made quite a few homemade costumes myself in my early days! As a matter of fact, they didn't look all that different from your own.", "Fiona"], ["Actually, yours may surpass even what I was able to make when I was your age! Your technical skill is remarkable for someone so young!", "Fiona"], ["...Well, I understand if that part of yourself is behind you now...", "Fiona"], ["...But know that if you ever took to the sewing machine again, I'd love to teach you some of my own techniques!", "Fiona"], ["...", "Fiona"], ["...Er, are you...okay, miss? You're...shaking.", "Fiona"], ["Oh dear, and you're red in the face. VERY red in the face. Um, um...do you need to see a doctor? Oh, I hope Nurse Dollie is nearby...", "Fiona"]];
                
                case UnknownEnum.Value_10:
                    return [["Mrs. Murray...How are you holding up?", "Henry"], ["It's been a struggle...But I'm adapting the best I can!", "Fiona"], ["This touch screen is quite new to me. Scurrying to get tokens for the shop is such a struggle...", "Fiona"], ["...Oh, goodness! I almost forgot to ask!", "Fiona"], ["I noticed your name on the start screens for all the little games. YOU made all these, Mr. Emily?", "Fiona"], ["Yes...Well, some of them seem as though they've been altered. Their sprites were swapped.", "Henry"], ["I know I never made my car racer to star a rotting...", "Henry"], ["Er, nevermind. Please continue.", "Henry"], ["I just wanted to say, arcade technology has...REALLY just come a long way!", "Fiona"], ["I remember watching Edwin stumble over himself trying to show me one of his fancy magazines...", "Fiona"], ["Gosh, it all seems so simple now, but he was ecstatic! You needed whole machines just to play one game!", "Fiona"], ["And you know Edwin, always wanting to hop onto the next big thing! Started on a text-based one that very night!", "Fiona"], ["...But then another piece of \"revolutionary technology\" caught his eye and...", "Fiona"], ["Well, you know Edwin.", "Fiona"], ["Still, I would have loved to try making a little something! Even if it's just for myself...", "Fiona"], ["Well, if you ask me, the most impressive advancement is these tablets being able to read the game boards.", "Henry"], ["Cartridges, too. The data reading on these things is something else!", "Henry"], ["Though, the simple arcade games on display here give a narrow scope of just how much games have developed.", "Henry"], ["All of this is simple?! My goodness, you've got me all jazzed! C'mon, let's walk and talk!", "Fiona"]];
                
                case UnknownEnum.Value_11:
                    return [["Ah, if it isn't the wife! Thank you for the drink, it's much appreciated.", "William"], ["Hey, don't mention it.", "Fiona"], ["Strange place, huh? Our own creations, turned against us...", "Fiona"], ["Yes, quite right. I've had to fend off two different versions of myself just this trip. Horrible facsimiles, they are!", "William"], ["...Ha. If I had known I'd need to fend off my own creations someday, I wouldn't have given Foxy so many teeth!", "Fiona"], ["The barmaid Chica is certainly an odd touch, too...", "Fiona"], ["...Oh, Tipsy Bird?", "William"], ["Pah, do you really think the wretch that runs this place could've come up with her? No, Tipsy Bird is singly and PROUDLY my own!", "William"], ["...YOU made her?", "Fiona"], ["Shortly after your husband's bankruptcy, yes. While our pizzerias were performing wonderfully, I knew our company was capable of much greater things!", "William"], ["There's only so much money to be made off of children, you see.", "William"], ["I knew if we wanted to take our corporation to the next level, we'd need to cut out the middleman and market directly to the parents.", "William"], ["And so, I began drafting my most brilliant restaurant concept yet...", "William"], ["An animatronic bar, with the best in automated entertainment AND enough hard liquor to make even an Irishman blush!", "William"], ["But oh, Henry - Henry just wouldn't HAVE it!", "William"], ["He said such a concept would be \"too damaging to the brand image\", or whatever hogwash he could come up with!", "William"], ["Really? ...Could only imagine why...", "Fiona"], ["Bah, that curmudgeon wouldn't know a good idea if it drove up and stabbed his daughter in a back alley! He was the death of our company, I say.", "William"], ["...He did like Tipsy, though.", "William"], ["Is that a fact...?", "Fiona"], ["Indeed. Henry can be a real thorn in my side...", "William"], ["...But if there's anything we can agree on, it's curvaceous animatronic chicken women.", "William"]];
                
                case UnknownEnum.Value_12:
                    return [["...F-Fiona!? No...no! Damn this place! It must be pulling another dirty trick on me!", "Edwin"], ["No, Ed! It's me! It's...really me!", "Fiona"], ["It...it is?", "Edwin"], ["My god, Fiona! I...", "Edwin"], ["I thought I'd never get to hold your beautiful face in my hands ever again!", "Edwin"], ["O-Oh! Honey, but I'm right here! I'm right...Oh, dear...", "Fiona"], ["I've missed you so much... You don't know how hard it's been for me...", "Edwin"], ["...How...How long has it been for you?", "Fiona"], ["S-Seven years! Seven long, agonizing years without you...", "Edwin"], ["It's been so difficult...Running the company without you, raising David without you...", "Edwin"], ["Hey, honey, it's okay, I'm here for you...", "Fiona"], ["...", "Fiona"], ["...Though, uh...", "Fiona"], ["What is it, honey? Please, don't hold back!", "Edwin"], ["Well, it's just...", "Fiona"], ["...On my way up here...", "Fiona"], ["Yes!?", "Edwin"], ["...There was this...blue rabbit thing that...spoke in my voice.", "Fiona"], ["But it didn't look real, it... it almost looked like something out of one of your old computer programs.", "Fiona"], ["Wha- They made M.X.E.S. into a RABBIT!?", "Edwin"], ["GAH, those TRAITORS! M.X.E.S. was supposed to be a SUN, not a RABBIT! Gah, they ruin everything!", "Edwin"], ["I...don't think I follow.", "Fiona"], ["Ah, it's a long story. I'll explain it on the way.", "Edwin"], ["...But really, I'm...glad to have you back.", "Edwin"]];
                
                case UnknownEnum.Value_15:
                    return [["...Omigosh. Omigosh omigosh omigosh.", "Cassie"], ["You're...Fiona! Fiona Murray!!", "Cassie"], ["Oh! Why, I...certainly didn't expect someone your age to recognize me.", "Fiona"], ["Are you kidding!? You're the one who made Roxy! I'm, like, NUTS about her!", "Cassie"], ["I did a report on her history for a school project! And I went SUPER deep on my research!", "Cassie"], ["...Probably deeper than ANYONE has. And that's how I found out about you!", "Cassie"], ["Heck, you made, like, ALL the Fazbear characters! ...Well, all the cool ones, at least.", "Cassie"], ["Oh! Well, I'm happy to know one of my characters had this kind of staying power!", "Fiona"], ["When Edwin had asked me to design her, she was really only meant to be something to put on a cutout for our wild west midway theme...", "Fiona"], ["...Which we didn't sell a whole lot of. Our clients always flocked towards the sci-fi theme instead...", "Fiona"], ["And even before that, he...er, she was just one of a handful of ensemble pirates. And not even the fan favorite among them, mind you!", "Fiona"], ["I guess she's kind of always struggled to find her audience...", "Fiona"], ["...So it's good to know she's got you!", "Fiona"], ["She doesn't JUST have me! She's one of the lead performers at the Pizzaplex!!!", "Cassie"], ["A HUGE mall with a bunch of cool activities and food, and Roxanne has an entire go karting raceway!!", "Cassie"], ["...Maybe it's in a bit of a rough state right now given the whole sinkhole situation, but she's still a lead star!!", "Cassie"], ["Oh, that sounds...wonderful! Gosh, I would've loved to see something like that...", "Fiona"], ["...Say, would you maybe wanna come along with me? Maybe if we get out of here, you'll get to see it all for yourself!", "Cassie"], ["...Plus, I could really use a friend down here. ESPECIALLY one as cool as you.", "Cassie"], ["...Aren't I a bit old to be your friend?", "Fiona"], ["...Oh, who am I kidding? We could certainly both use one right now!", "Fiona"], ["Mhm! Me especially!", "Cassie"]];
                
                case UnknownEnum.Value_18:
                    return [["My goodness, look at you! I didn't know there were waiters here!", "Fiona"], ["Waiter? Yes! I am WAITING for you to realize I'm incapable of drinking this!", "Strings"], ["O-Oh! I'm such a harebrain. I just wanted to get you something because you looked like you've been working so hard!", "Fiona"], ["...I have. I HAVE!", "Strings"], ["The labor I have undertaken has been most clamorous! Notation on this realm is positively...", "Strings"], ["...inexplainable...unnatural...foreboding...", "Strings"], ["THIS PLACE IS NUTS!", "Strings"], ["No kidding, and I certainly don't blame the bee in your bonnet for being so high strung!", "Fiona"], ["...?", "Strings"], ["You know! You're in a bag!", "Fiona"], ["...HUH?", "Strings"], ["...I-I was just using slang, that's all.", "Fiona"], ["Your vernacular is COMPLETELY out of date! It's incompatible. Inapt! IRRELEVANT!", "Strings"], ["No one talks like that anymore.", "Strings"], ["O-Oh. I...I guess I've been out of the picture for longer than I thought...", "Fiona"], ["WORRY NOT! You've shown sympathy to my efforts, and it will not go unnoticed!", "Strings"], ["I shall act as your historical mentor!", "Strings"], ["First query: have you seen the .mp4 \"Relaxing Car Drive\"?", "Strings"]];
                
                case UnknownEnum.Value_14:
                    return [["My... Is it safe to be wearing skates in here?", "Fiona"], ["Don't worry, miss! I'm very good at it. I pulled myself up on this stool just fine!", "Elizabeth"], ["Alright! Just...watch out for any spills...", "Fiona"], ["It's funny. I never realized how difficult skating WAS until I made Party Time Chica...", "Fiona"], ["...Though, maybe having to skate in a big mascot suit was what made it so hard...?", "Fiona"], ["Party Time Chica...?", "Elizabeth"], ["Oh, she's a big round yellow chicken! I haven't seen her here, but there's plenty of other Chicas around!", "Fiona"], ["Her design had a bit of a rough transition to a suit, but-", "Fiona"], ["Oh no, miss, you must be mistaken! Daddy made Chica all by himself!", "Elizabeth"], ["He was quite proud of his in... inclus... inclisive... kindness by adding a lady to the band!", "Elizabeth"], ["...Huh?", "Fiona"], ["That's...Very strange...", "Fiona"], ["...Could you, um, tell me more?", "Fiona"], ["But of course!", "Elizabeth"]];
                
                default:
                    return bar_dialogue_array(-1, arg1);
            }
        
